# CF_DNS_API_TOKEN cannot be auto-generated — create it yourself:
# Cloudflare dashboard -> My Profile -> API Tokens -> Create Token ->
# "Edit zone DNS" template, scoped to your domain's zone only (not
# account-wide). Used for the DNS-01 ACME challenge that gets Traefik a
# real Let's Encrypt cert for LAN split-horizon access.
CF_DNS_API_TOKEN=
